    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1.1
  m_Text: 'Our daughter went missing yesterday evening and has not been found since.


    She
    is seven years old, has shoulder-length black hair, stands around 130 cm tall,
    and was last seen wearing a white top with a light-colored skirt, holding a brown
    teddy bear.


    She is quiet and easily frightened, and unlikely to speak with
    strangers.

    If you have seen a girl matching this description, please contact
    us immediately.


    Contact Number: XXXX-XXXX

    Address: No. XX, XX Village



    Any
    information will be of great importance. Please help us find her.'
